Z||000019||Return of Fiero||11-27-2001||06:24 AM||||you know, when I lived in Manchester, for anyone in the area who might have see it, yes im the sicko, i used to live on Pine St. across the parking lot from mike grubby pub, rather pub and grub. i was the one who hung lights from my window around a lit up santa's neck with the "spank me" sign on it. got some neat praise from it, varing from, HA HA HA to YOU PIG!. really brought out the best in people.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Now its lights in the window, and cutesy things, because i have kids. hey, what the hell, i kind of like this cutesy crap.<BR>Myke||||reg||1
